# Unwanted Remake: "its controller" is whoever controls the creature, which here is Bot1 itself: Bot1 destroys its own Memnite and
# Bot1 manifests dread (Gorilla face down, Bolt to the graveyard), and Bot2 does not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Unwanted Remake
Island
Island
Island
Island
Guerrilla Gorilla
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Unwanted Remake.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Guerrilla Gorilla | Lightning Bolt)
[T1 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
